# ============================================================
# Hearthrise — .gitignore
# ============================================================
# Excludes raw asset libraries (purchased icon packs, source PSDs,
# zips, etc.) from version control + deploys. Only files actually
# referenced by the game ship to production.
# ============================================================

# Raw asset libraries (Itch.io / Poneti / CraftPix packs — not loaded at runtime).
# The USED subset is downscaled into assets/icons-bundle/painted/ and IS shipped;
# these raw sources stay out of the repo + deploy. As of the 2026-08-08 asset
# pass they live under _archive/raw-packs/ (covered by the _archive/ rule below);
# the bare names are kept so any stray copy stays ignored too.
icons2/
icons3/
icons4/
Icons/
assets/pixel/

# Quarantine / cold-storage for the asset-organization pass (2026-08-08).
# Everything here is recoverable but intentionally OUT of the deploy:
#   _archive/reserve-art/    — unused-but-style-compatible painted icons
#                              (future-content material/building/monster art)
#   _archive/pixel-packs/    — the abandoned pixel-art packs (was assets/pixel/)
#   _archive/asset-tooling/  — icon-curation HTML/JSON/TXT dev tools
# See _archive/README.md and ASSET_MANIFEST.md.
_archive/

# Local-only legacy monoliths superseded by src/ + index.html
.legacy/
hearthbound.html
hearthbound-v2.html
hearthbound-phaseA.html
hearthrise-phaseA.html
style-lanes.html

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node (in case any tooling sneaks in)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log

# Local environment + secrets (keep examples in .env.example if needed)
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Build output / scratch
dist/
build/
*.log

# Document working files (the .docx + .xlsx live in repo for reference,
# but ignore Office lock files)
~$*
.claude/worktrees/
docs/reports/visual-qa/*.png

# Local MCP server config (points at Supabase project; no secret, but dev-only)
.mcp.json

# stray local artifact — not part of the deploy
hearthrise-map.html

# live-probe output written into the repo root by tools/probe-intent.mjs and
# tools/race-test.mjs. Response bodies from a real signed-in account — never commit.
probe-intent-out.json
race-out.txt

# Hearthfire art pilot RAWS (1024px Recraft exports) — source only, never shipped.
# The processed shipping copies live in assets/icons-bundle/hearthfire/.
assets/art-pilot/

# Prefab avatar SOURCES (b360). The Recraft originals are 1024², ~1.5–2.3 MB each
# and must never bloat the deploy. Only the processed 256² .webp portraits and the
# neutral placeholder ship from assets/avatars/ — ignore every raw .png/.jpg there.
assets/avatars/*.png
assets/avatars/*.jpg
assets/avatars/*.jpeg

# Mutation-harness journal (tests/mutation-safety.mjs). Written before a
# harness mutates a production file, deleted after a hash-verified restore.
# A committed one would mean a run died holding a mutation.
tests/.mutation-journal.json

# watermark-fixed item sources (handoff to item pipeline; not shipped as-is)
assets/_wm-fixed-item-sources/
